# Tech Stack

## Frontend Core

### Next.js 16
The new version of Next.js with:
- **App Router** - Server Components by default
- **API Routes** - Easy endpoint creation
- **Image Optimization** - Optimal image loading
- **Turbopack** - Faster bundler

```typescript
// src/app/page.tsx
export default function HomePage() {
  return <div>Hello World</div>;
}
```

### React 19
The new version of React:
- Server Components
- Concurrent Features
- Improved Hooks

### TypeScript 5.x
Full type safety:
```typescript
interface Book {
  id: string;
  title: string;
  chapters: Chapter[];
}

interface Page {
  type: 'text' | 'image';
  content: string;
}
```

### Tailwind CSS 4
Utility-first styling:
```tsx
<div className="bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-6 hover:shadow-lg transition-all">
  <h2 className="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Title</h2>
</div>
```

### Lucide React
Modern icon library:
```tsx
import { BookOpen, Bot, Sparkles } from 'lucide-react';

<Bot className="w-5 h-5 text-purple-600" />
```

### Google Fonts
Three fonts in use:
- **Heebo** - Hebrew UI
- **Frank Ruhl Libre** - Literary content (serif)
- **Inter** - Technical text

## AI & APIs (for challenges)

### Vercel AI SDK
```typescript
import { generateText, tool } from 'ai';
import { openai } from '@ai-sdk/openai';

const result = await generateText({
  model: openai('gpt-4o-mini'),
  prompt: 'Write a story continuation...',
});
```

### OpenAI GPT-4.1
- **gpt-4o-mini** - Fast and cheap, perfect for learning
- **gpt-4o** - More advanced
- **Function Calling** - For agents

### ElevenLabs
Voice reading:
```typescript
const response = await fetch(
  'https://api.elevenlabs.io/v1/text-to-speech/VOICE_ID',
  {
    headers: { 'xi-api-key': API_KEY },
    body: JSON.stringify({
      text: content,
      model_id: 'eleven_multilingual_v2'
    })
  }
);
```

### fal.ai
Image generation for stories:
```typescript
import { fal } from '@fal-ai/serverless-client';

const result = await fal.subscribe('fal-ai/flux', {
  input: { prompt: 'A magical forest scene' }
});
```

## State Management

### React useState/useEffect
Local state management:
```typescript
const [book, setBook] = useState<Book | null>(null);
const [selectedPage, setSelectedPage] = useState<Page | null>(null);

useEffect(() => {
  fetchBookData();
}, [bookId]);
```

### localStorage
Local storage:
```typescript
localStorage.setItem(`book_${bookId}`, JSON.stringify(book));
const saved = localStorage.getItem(`book_${bookId}`);
```

## Data Layer

### Static JSON Database
`db.json` file with all data:
```typescript
import dbData from '@/data/db.json';

export function getBooks(): Book[] {
  return db.books;
}
```
